{"ticker":"ADBE","updated":"2026-10-23T22:33:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Adobe Inc.","shortName":"Adobe Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.adobe.com","fullTimeEmployees":31360,"marketCap":102678749184,"trailingPE":14.730319,"forwardPE":9.590818,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.9537446,"pegRatio":0.62,"targetMeanPrice":272.31375,"targetHighPrice":373.0,"targetLowPrice":195.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.129,"earningsGrowth":0.105,"grossMargins":0.89252996,"operatingMargins":0.34822,"profitMargins":0.28048,"totalRevenue":25969999872,"beta":1.415,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":363.7,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":190.12,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Adobe Inc. operates as a technology company worldwide. The Digital Media segment offers products and services that enable individuals, teams, and enterprises to create, publish, and promote content. This segment serves photographers, video editors, graphic and experience designers, game developers, content creators, students, marketers, business owners, knowledge workers, and consumers. The Digital Experience segment provides an integrated platform; and products, services, and solutions that enable brands and businesses to create, manage, execute, measure, monetize, and optimize customer experiences from analytics to commerce. This segment serves marketers, advertisers, agencies, publishers, merchandisers, merchants, web analysts, data scientists, developers, and executives across the C-suite. The Publishing and Advertising segment offers e-learning, technical document publishing, web conferencing, document and forms platform, web application development, printing, and Adobe Advertising solutions. It also provides consulting, training, customer management, technical support, and learning services. The company offers its solutions to enterprise customers, and businesses and consumers; and licenses its products to end-user customers through app stores and website at adobe.com. It markets and distributes its products through distributors, retailers, software developers, mobile app","summary_zh":"Adobe Inc. 以全球科技公司營運。數位媒體部門提供使個人、團隊和企業能夠創建、發布和推廣內容的產品和服務。該細分市場為攝影師、影片編輯、圖形和體驗設計師、遊戲開發人員、內容創作者、學生、行銷人員、企業主、知識工作者和消費者提供服務。數位體驗部分提供了一個整合平台；以及產品、服務和解決方案，使品牌和企業能夠創建、管理、執行、衡量、貨幣化和優化從分析到商務的客戶體驗。該部門為行銷人員、廣告商、代理商、出版商、採購商、商人、網路分​​析師、資料科學家、開發人員和整個高階主管的高階主管提供服務。出版和廣告部門提供電子學習、技術文件出版、網路會議、文件和表格平台、網路應用程式開發、列印和 Adob​​e 廣告解決方案。它還提供諮詢、培訓、客戶管理、技術支援和學習服務。該公司為企業客戶、企業和消費者提供解決方案；並透過應用程式商店和 adobe.com 網站向最終用戶客戶授權其產品。它透過分銷商、零售商、軟體開發商、行動應用程式行銷和分銷其產品","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":362.56,"h":364.65,"l":361.4,"c":363.21,"v":2259500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":363.03,"h":363.23,"l":353.7,"c":354.91,"v":4067400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":355.98,"h":360.37,"l":355.16,"c":356.35,"v":2353800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":357.63,"h":358.26,"l":349.11,"c":353.96,"v":3803100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":354.0,"h":357.25,"l":352.46,"c":356.7,"v":2639300},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":350.24,"h":352.71,"l":341.28,"c":345.63,"v":4229400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":345.72,"h":348.51,"l":343.36,"c":348.5,"v":3035300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":342.24,"h":344.41,"l":331.5,"c":344.31,"v":4918300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":345.81,"h":354.67,"l":345.1,"c":348.97,"v":4662600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":348.86,"h":358.82,"l":343.59,"c":358.66,"v":5043300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":362.75,"h":362.75,"l":353.03,"c":354.06,"v":4324900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":356.29,"h":359.19,"l":348.12,"c":350.16,"v":4552500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":354.69,"h":355.25,"l":347.16,"c":350.55,"v":11804200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":361.1,"h":366.5,"l":341.61,"c":349.36,"v":14146600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":350.5,"h":358.0,"l":345.05,"c":347.1,"v":6768600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":350.16,"h":356.94,"l":348.32,"c":352.73,"v":6697000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":353.18,"h":365.0,"l":353.18,"c":362.07,"v":6449900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":366.86