夥伴"},{"title":"Contract awarded for two level crossings","src":"Council Magazine","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE94dkxGWG55TVVmU1JsVm5xNDVTeHFDQ2EzaWU1b1RQbkR1S2FxbkczMWtQLTVPRFE2SDVweGdtSWZpZDdhRmNKQTVPQU5nSWpzZEZ2Sy1jLTZoMGJYSXVRY2Q0UXdCT1RCb3RwNWlYRTU2M2JwSE45elVqb20?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"授予兩個平交道合約"},{"title":"Adobe makes first move into F1 with Alpine deal","src":"The Race","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOVkltQnNPR3VrZlhnaWxHSXVhRlM5VmhjZ2UzeWNQS2NpWmlkaEpWX0FEazlqeUlkZEo3NHhxR0NnS2J4eFVCTkVnUTR4aG9TWk1NMFZTVXp3VHcxTU54ZHcxSUhqWVdudXg2c2pDM20zQ1ktUzJDbkl1MDU0X1RaeUZ2YVNPWUxDX1E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Adobe 與 Alpine 達成交易，首次進軍 F1"},{"title":"Adobe becomes AI fan experience partner of BWT Alpine F1 team","src":"The Next Web","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE1qQkgxbXdMZnA5VlU3TnF3al9vWHoyX2ZrQVpDMHJFa1NHZUdPaWxUdE9CMENaVEx3U1F1RVFvYjFTbVJoQXRkcS1OY05rQWRQMGZ2bi1OelV0NXcxcEp5dEFhLXVwblRReHFaMEh6RQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Adobe 成為 BWT Alpine F1 車隊 AI 球迷體驗合作夥伴"},{"title":"Adobe signs deal with BWT Alpine Formula One","src":"Sports Business Journal","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNX3NhYmRaR2JvRGpJeVdMa1VLb3VCaFptdm12NzItUmlRdDZEd2dXTU1CN3Z1YkxmMXpqTUVKc1d0NlRsUEFvYWFwVWc2aGlTa2duMHIydUZkeTZGTkRNRHk0a0dYV19tb19YcFFDai1mVjRNal9ZVVFwM1ZRTUlsTTJHYWU3VzNwMGRmcWRwNGUtdndaYi0xVEItWk1WdS1OaVJyRWx3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Adobe 與 BWT Alpine 一級方程式賽車簽署協議"},{"title":"Roundup: Alcon Acquires Neurotech and Encelto, Ai Proteins Enters Research Collaboration and License Agreement with Astellas Pharma","src":"Pharmaceutical Executive","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNRV9IRUdfLTBhOS11eHlkMm1rQVNkVWp0M0VhQXNfRlh5Q3l6eldpREg5NS16TFRlbGFDb1F5ZzdYTmY1QkNEcTk2ZWs1emJRX2tkQVpGMk1xWGQwaHlmNDVmaDhNcmlZT2VWSEs4X2ZNOGIwQ2p0eGdKZVI5eTJESzMtRmJJdkhmWjJTcmt6dzAxaGhyOVg4VEhGVktuNjhZWTJ0QzNkR19veEhtMVl4Z0pTaVBOTVBPOFlJR2ZQSmZZNFhJOVI3VTV1cEY?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"綜述：愛爾康收購 Neurotech 和 Encelto，Ai Proteins 與 Astellas Pharma 達成研究合作和授權協議"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":5},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-15","period":"2025-11-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/796343/000079634326000003/adbe-20251128.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Adobe's mission is to empower everyone to create. We build innovative platforms and tools that unleash creativity, productivity and personalized customer experiences. For over four decades, our innovations have transformed how people everywhere engage across all types of media. Adobe's solutions are the foundation of digital experiences, starting with the first creative spark, to the creation and development of all content and media, to the personalized delivery across every channel.","zh":"Adobe 的使命是讓每個人都能創造。我們建構創新平台和工具，釋放創造力、生產力和個人化客戶體驗。四十多年來，我們的創新改變了世界各地的人們參與各類媒體的方式。 Adobe 的解決方案是數位體驗的基礎，從第一個創意火花開始，到所有內容和媒體的創建和開發，再到跨每個管道的個人化交付。"},{"en":"Our focus revolves around serving our customer audiences: business professionals, consumers, creators, creative professionals and marketing professionals. The massive opportunity and evolving role of creativity across roles and industries have driven Adobe's growth over the past four decades and are expected to continue to drive our growth going forward as we evolve our solutions and routes to market to anticipate the growing needs of our customers. In the artificial intelligence (\"AI\") era, we are harnessing the power of AI across our solutions by bringing together our commercially safe first-party and leading partner AI models best suited for the job; deploying conversational and agentic capabilities across offerings; ensuring ubiquity on all surfaces; delivering trusted and secure solutions; and expanding our global presence.","zh":"我們的重點是為客戶群提供服務：商業專業人士、消費者、創作者、創意專業人士和行銷專業人士。在過去的四十年裡，跨角色和跨行業的創造力的巨大機會和不斷變化的作用推動了 Adob​​e 的成長，並且隨著我們不斷發展我們的解決方案和市場路線以預測客戶不斷增長的需求，預計將繼續推動我們的成長。在人工智慧（「AI」）時代，我們透過將商業安全的第一方和最適合該工作的領先合作夥伴人工智慧模型結合在一起，在我們的解決方案中利用人工智慧的力量；跨產品部署對話和代理功能；確保在所有表面上普遍存在；提供值得信賴且安全的解決方案；並擴大我們的全球影響力。"},{"en":"Adobe's value proposition is to empower creative expression across multiple media types and channels, at scale, in a collaborative and secure environment, with an end-to-end integrated platform spanning ideation, creation, production and activation. We power the entire content workflow with Adobe's AI platform, which offers customers brand safety, compliance, intellectual property protection, and reliability.","zh":"Adobe 的價值主張是透過涵蓋構思、創作、製作和激活的端到端整合平台，在協作和安全的環境中大規模地跨多種媒體類型和管道進行創意表達。我們利用 Adob​​e 的 AI 平台為整個內容工作流程提供支持，為客戶提供品牌安全、合規性、智慧財產權保護和可靠性。"}],"markets":[{"en":"In fiscal 2025, our business consisted of three reportable segments: Digital Media, Digital Experience and Publishing and Advertising. Spanning both our Digital Media and Digital Experience segments, we drove business success through customer-focused innovation and go-to-market strategies.","zh":"2025 財年，我們的業務由三個可報告部門組成：數位媒體、數位體驗以及出版和廣告。跨越數位媒體和數位體驗領域，我們透過以客戶為中心的創新和進入市場策略來推動業務成功。"},{"en":"Digital Media. To serve the productivity and creativity needs of business professionals, consumers, creators and creative professionals, our Digital Media solutions include our Adobe Acrobat solutions, Adobe Express and our Creative Cloud subscriptions and flagship apps, such as Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Lightroom, Adobe Premiere Pro and Adobe After Effects, as well as Adobe Firefly.","zh":"數位媒體。為了滿足商業專業人士、消費者、創作者和創意專業人士的生產力和創造力需求，我們的數位媒體解決方案包括 Adob​​e Acrobat 解決方案、Adobe Express 以及 Creative Cloud 訂閱和旗艦應用程序，例如 Adob​​e Adob​​e"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We participate in a highly competitive and rapidly evolving environment where our competitors include companies of various sizes and both public and private companies, including large, global companies and smaller companies with more specialized focuses, new entrants, and AI or cloud-native companies. We compete with software companies, AI companies, hardware manufacturers, operating system developers, and social media companies across our business. The markets for our solutions are characterized by rapid technological innovation, new industry standards, evolving distribution and sales models, limited barriers to entry, short product lifecycles, customer price sensitivity, global economic conditions and the frequent entry of new solutions or competitors.","zh":"我們身處一個競爭激烈且快速發展的環境，我們的競爭對手包括各種規模的公司、上市公司和私人公司，包括大型跨國公司和專注於更專業的小型公司、新進業者以及人工智慧或雲端原生公司。我們在整個業務領域與軟體公司、人工智慧公司、硬體製造商、作業系統開發商和社交媒體公司競爭。我們的解決方案市場的特點是快速的技術創新、新的行業標準、不斷發展的分銷和銷售模式、有限的進入壁壘、較短的產品生命週期、客戶價格敏感性、全球經濟狀況以及新解決方案或競爭對手的頻繁進入。"},{"en":"Our future success will depend on our ability to effectively appeal to customers and accurately predict and meet changing customer needs by enhancing our existing solutions and introducing new ones in a timely and cost-effective manner. We need to anticipate emerging standards, business models, software delivery methods, and other technological changes.","zh":"我們未來的成功將取決於我們透過增強現有解決方案並及時且經濟高效地引入新解決方案來有效吸引客戶並準確預測和滿足不斷變化的客戶需求的能力。我們需要預測新興標準、商業模式、軟體交付方法和其他技術變革。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-11-28","items":[{"name":"Digital Media","val":17649000000,"zh":"數位媒體"},{"name":"Digital Experience","val":5864000000,"zh":"數位體驗"},{"name":"Publishing & Advertising","val":256000000,"zh":"出版及廣告"}],"total":23769000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-11-28","items":[{"name":"Subscription Revenue","val":22904000000,"zh":"訂閱收入"},{"name":"Service Other","val":540000000,"zh":"服務其他"},{"name":"Product","val":325000000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":23769000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-11-28","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":14120000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":12529000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":6289000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":3360000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":1591000000,"zh":"其他美洲"}],"total":23769000000}},"peers":["CRM","PYPL","NOW","SHOP","CRWD"]}}